{1}{Sorry sir. I'm afraid it's gonna be at least a fortnight 'til we can get ol' Sally back on track. *In the meantime please enjoy your stay in lovely Nodnol. It's got all the modern conveniences.* [That last part sounded a little rehearsed.]}{Sorry ma'am. I'm afraid it's gonna be at least a fortnight 'til we can get ol' Sally back on track. In the meantime please enjoy your stay in lovely Nodnol. It's got all the modern conveniences. [That last part sounded a little rehearsed.]}{}{}{}{}
