{82}{Fine, I'll leave then.}{}{1}{}{0}{}
{101}{[He leans towards you to whisper] There be somethin' not right 'bout the goings on in Nodnol. I can't put me finger on it, but I venture it has somethin' to do with the city's founder and mayor, Heroman. Now I ain't got no solid poof mind ye. It's just this here feelin' I got in me gut. [He jabs at his stomach.] All I gots ta say is be careful. Eyes 'round here tend ta lay heavy on strangers like yerself.}{[He leans towards you to whisper] There be somethin' not right 'bout the goings on in Nodnol. I can't put me finger on it, but I venture it has somethin' to do with the city's founder and mayor, Heroman. Now I ain't got no solid poof mind ye. It's just this here feelin' I got in me gut. [He jabs at his stomach.] All I gots ta say is be careful. Eyes 'round here tend ta lay heavy on strangers like yerself.}{}{}{}{}
